```console
$ redkiln cost --help
Report the headroom an item's dispatches drew, as a batch delta or the reason none is quoted

Usage: redkiln cost [OPTIONS] <ITEM>

Arguments:
  <ITEM>  The item whose dispatches to report

Options:
  -C <PATH>   Act on the repository at this path instead of the working directory
  -h, --help  Print help

```
